  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Well you see, if you do it just a little differently… you’re done that much quicker!”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Gather power class feature, 5th-level kineticist</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use your gather power class feature, you can also spend a standard action to reduce the total burn cost of a blast wild talent used on your next turn by 2. At 11th level you can spend a standard action to reduce the total burn cost of a wild talent used on your next turn by 3. Gathering power in this way ends your turn immediately. You cannot gather power on your next round on your next round as a move action to further reduce burn cost.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
